On 15 f=E9v, 11:08, dogscoff <dogsc...@eudoramail.com> wrote:
> If I get a chaotic magicbane as a chaotic wizard then leave it in a
> bones file, will it revert to neutral for whatever player picks it up?

As far as I understand the source code, Magicbane will revert to
neutral unless the hero who finds the bone is also a wizard whose
starting alignment is chaotic.

Unless I'm mistaken, artifact properties are stored in the artilist
array, defined in file artilist.h. This array is updated at each game
start/restore in function hack_artifacts so that artifacts tied to the
role of the hero (Magicbane is tied to wizards) get the starting
alignment of the hero.

In file artifact.c, hack_artifact is called in both functions
init_artifacts and restore_artifacts.

